// `Conditioned by` filters: an instance that fails its conditions is not derived and is not enabled.
Fact player
Fact input Identified by Int
Fact jc Identified by player
  Holds when (input < 10)
  Conditioned by (input > 5)
Fact jackpot Identified by player Holds when jc().
+player(P).
+input(3).
?!jackpot(P).
-input.
+input(6).
?jackpot(P).
